// Generated from infra/envs/prod.json by `cargo xtask infra up`; edit the spec, not this file.
// Today's live production (old single-Worker layout), as last deployed on 2026-10-15 from
// the private .local/deploy/production/platform.json: a prebuilt runtime image, one container
